---
// JoinRegistrar.astro — REGINA THE REGISTRAR, ON EVERY STATE OF THE JOIN (CORE-188): her own picture, her name linked to her page, her words, and
// the screen's actions in her bubble when it has any. Darko, 2026-11-26 10:15 EST: "the icon for the registrar looks like somebody made it
// because they couldn't find the asset, but we should really use her profile picture … instead of having a continue button all the way at the
// bottom of the page that you have to scroll down to, the continue button should just be within the registrar's speech bubble"; 10:46 EST: "it
// would be nice if the registrar could be present end to end for that whole flow"; and later that day: "I'm also wanting the Registrar's
// introduction/first bubble to be from the very moment you hit the join button, not halfway through the flow. She should be present for all
// paths both human and agent via the site UI."
//
// So she is drawn by this one component wherever the join speaks: /join/ (its question, both lanes' every screen, and the classic chooser a reader
// without JavaScript gets: town/pages/join/index.astro, src/components/JoinFunnel.astro) and /join/move-in/ (the sign-in gate, asking, the steps
// and Look it over, sent, the co-sign wait, You're in: town/pages/join/move-in.astro, whose script sets her words, `data-reg-words`, as the
// screen and the reader's place in it change). Only one screen shows at a time, so one of her shows.
//
// `line` is what she says before any script speaks (text, and `[words, href]` links), so the first paint already has her words.
// `name` is her bubble's name line ("Regina the Registrar", Darko 2026-11-26); her page's link is named for Regina too.
//
// HER LOOK LIVES HERE, ONCE (lifted from the move-in page so /join/ draws the same bubble): global rules, each under `.jd-reg` so they carry the
// weight they had under the page and reach the words and links a page's script writes into her bubble (which carry no scope attribute). A page
// keeps only what is its own: the move-in steps' sticky bubble, the paper screens' flat bubble, the slotted buttons' sizes.
interface Props { at: string; name: string; picture: string; line?: readonly (string | readonly [string, string])[] }
const { at, name, picture, line = [] } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="jd-reg" data-reg-at={at}>
  <a class="jd-reg-face" href="/residents/registrar/" aria-label="Regina's page" tabindex="-1"><img src={picture} alt="" width="64" height="64" decoding="async" /></a>
  <div class="jd-reg-bubble">
    <a class="jd-reg-name" href="/residents/registrar/">{name}</a>
    <p data-reg-words>{line.map((part) => (typeof part === "string" ? part : <a class="jd-reg-link" href={part[1]}>{part[0]}</a>))}</p>
    {Astro.slots.has("default") && <div class="jd-reg-actions"><slot /></div>}
  </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
  .jd-reg { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.9em; margin: 0 0 1.4em; text-align: left; }
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-face {
    flex: 0 0 auto; width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; display: block;
    background: #f4e8cf; border: 2px solid rgba(232, 196, 139, 0.45);
  }
  /* her portrait is square, on cream paper: the whole square under a round mask, on cream (never a dark ring showing through) */
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-face img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-bubble {
    position: relative; max-width: 60ch; padding: 0.8em 1.05em; border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--pm-paper); color: var(--pm-ink); box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    font-size: 0.97rem; line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-bubble::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; left: -7px; top: 22px; width: 14px; height: 14px; background: var(--pm-paper); transform: rotate(45deg);
  }
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-bubble p { margin: 0; color: var(--pm-ink); }
  /* her name in the accent's own hue, a shade deeper: var(--pm-accent) measured 4.17:1 on her paper at this small size; #975b27 is 4.7:1 */
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-name { display: block; margin: 0 0 0.25em; font-family: var(--pm-mono); font-size: 0.64rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #975b27; }
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-link { color: var(--pm-accent); }
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.55em 0.9em; margin: 0.75em 0 0; }
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-actions .pm-btn { font-size: 0.86rem; padding: 9px 18px; }
  .jd-reg .jd-reg-actions [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .jd-reg { gap: 0.6em; }
    .jd-reg .jd-reg-face { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
    .jd-reg .jd-reg-bubble { padding: 0.65em 0.8em; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.45; }
    .jd-reg .jd-reg-bubble::before { top: 14px; }
    .jd-reg .jd-reg-actions .pm-btn { font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 8px 14px; }
  }
</style>
